==Description==
'''Bell''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[Operation I.C.E Event]] on any map and gamemode. It was obtainable by killing enemies which each had a chance to drop '''Bells''', though these enemies had no special accessories to indicate that they would drop '''Bells'''. 

It was used to complete Levels on the [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]]. The amount earned per wave varied based on the gamemode played.

It took the appearance of a golden bell with a red ribbon tied around it.

